---

<Base
  title="Placement Process | Cayto Group"
  meta_title="Placement Process | Cayto Group"
  description="Cayto Group connects you with highly qualified, thoroughly vetted accounting professionals who seamlessly integrate into your team. 2x the resume for 1/2 the cost."
